1
00:04:02,608 --> 00:04:08,608
Northanger Abbey is a romance, drama, tv movie film directed by Jon Jones.

2
00:08:05,217 --> 00:08:11,217
A young woman's penchant for sensational Gothic novels leads to
misunderstandings in the matters of the heart.

3
00:12:07,826 --> 00:12:13,826
Catherine Morland, played by Felicity Jones.

4
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:16,434
Isabella Thorpe, played by Carey Mulligan.

5
00:20:13,043 --> 00:20:19,043
Henry Tilney, played by JJ Feild.

6
00:24:15,652 --> 00:24:21,652
Jane Austen (voice), played by Geraldine James.

7
00:28:18,260 --> 00:28:24,260
Mrs Allen, played by Sylvestra Le Touzel.

8
00:32:20,869 --> 00:32:26,869
Mr Allen, played by Desmond Barrit.

9
00:36:23,478 --> 00:36:29,478
Northanger Abbey is a 2007 British television film adaptation
of Jane Austen's 1817 novel of the same name.

10
00:40:26,086 --> 00:40:32,086
It was directed by British television director Jon Jones and
the screenplay was written by Andrew Davies.

11
00:44:28,695 --> 00:44:34,695
Felicity Jones stars as the protagonist Catherine Morland and
JJ Feild plays her love interest Henry Tilney.

12
00:48:31,304 --> 00:48:37,304
The story unfolds as the teenaged Catherine is invited to
Bath to accompany some family friends.

13
00:52:33,913 --> 00:52:39,913
There she finds herself the object of Henry Tilney's and
John Thorpe's (William Beck) affections.

14
00:56:36,521 --> 00:56:42,521
When she is asked to stay at Northanger Abbey, Catherine's youthful and naive imagination takes hold
and she begins to confuse real life with the Gothic romance of her favourite novels.

15
01:00:39,130 --> 01:00:45,130
Northanger Abbey was one of three novels adapted for ITV's Jane Austen season.

16
01:04:41,739 --> 01:04:47,739
It was shot on location in Ireland from late
August 2006 on a budget of £2 million.

17
01:08:44,347 --> 01:08:50,347
The drama was co-produced by Granada Productions
and American studio WGBH Boston.

18
01:12:46,956 --> 01:12:52,956
Northanger Abbey premiered on 25 March 2007 in the United
Kingdom and on 16 December 2007 in Canada.

19
01:16:49,565 --> 01:16:55,565
It was broadcast in the United States and Australia in 2008.

20
01:20:52,173 --> 01:20:58,173
The drama was viewed by 5.6 million people in the UK, making it
the second most watched of the 2007 adaptations.

21
01:24:54,782 --> 01:25:00,782
Northanger Abbey garnered mostly positive reviews from television
critics, with many praising the cast's performances.

22
01:28:57,391 --> 01:29:03,391
The tone is emotional.
